flowchart TD
    U[Analyst in Streamlit<br/>access code + daily cap] -->|question| ST[select_tables<br/>Gemini]
    ST --> GS[generate_sql<br/>Gemini structured output]
    GS --> V{validate<br/>sqlglot guard}
    V -->|violation, retries ≤ 2| GS
    V -->|ambiguous| HR[human_review<br/>LangGraph interrupt]
    V -->|ok| CA{check_approval<br/>EXPLAIN via MCP}
    CA -->|DB error, retries ≤ 2| GS
    CA -->|> threshold rows| HR
    HR -->|clarification| GS
    HR -->|approved| EX[execute<br/>run_readonly_query via MCP]
    HR -->|rejected| RJ[rejected]
    CA -->|cheap| EX
    EX -->|DB error, retries ≤ 2| GS
    EX --> SM[summarize<br/>answer + chart spec]
    V -->|retries exhausted| F[fail]
    SM --> U
    subgraph MCP[MCP server · FastMCP · stdio]
      T1[list_tables] --- T2[describe_table] --- T3[run_readonly_query] --- T4[estimate_query_cost] --- T5[get_metric_definition]
    end
    EX -.-> MCP
    CA -.-> MCP
    MCP -->|guard again, then copilot_ro role<br/>read-only, 10s timeout| DB[(PostgreSQL warehouse<br/>dbt marts)]
    ST -.-> LF[Langfuse traces]
    GS -.-> LF
    SM -.-> LF
